  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop or crush garlic. In a medium saucepan, melt butter with a dash of olive oil over medium heat.\n• Cook 1/2 the garlic until fragrant, 1-2 mins. Add water, rice and a pinch of salt and bring to the boil. Reduce heat to low and cover with a lid.\n• Cook for 10 mins, then remove from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and water absorbed, 10 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/603594c9f930d87dd914cb25/step-404ed7c3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, quarter each piece of tofu.\n• Roughly chop capsicum. Thinly slice zucchini into half-moons. Thinly slice the red onion.\n• Finely grate ginger. In a small bowl, combine ginger, sweet chilli sauce, soy sauce, white wine vinegar, remaining garlic and a pinch of pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/603594c9f930d87dd914cb25/step-48af61fe.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook tofu, tossing, until browned and warmed through, 4 mins. Transfer to a plate.\n• Return frying pan to high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Stir-fry capsicum, zucchini and onion until tender, 5-7 mins. Remove from heat. Return tofu to pan and add the sweet chilli mixture. Cook, tossing, until heated through, 1 min. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/603594c9f930d87dd914cb25/step-f1a2d846.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide garlic rice between bowls.\n• Top with sweet chilli tofu and veggies.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/603594c9f930d87dd914cb25/step-23181ef9.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
